{"mode":"words","text":"Yukarıda, metni uygulamanın sana gösterdiği şekliyle görebilirsin. Her kelime küçük bir kart gibidir: üstte hedef dilindeki kelime, altında ise ana dilindeki anlamı yer alır — kelime kelime, hedef dilin sırasına göre. Bunun altında ise tüm cümle akıcı bir şekilde çevrilmiş olarak tekrar yer alır. Farklı bir yazı sistemine sahip dillerde, her şeyi okuyabilmen için bir satırlık transliterasyon eklenir. Bir kelimeye dokun: Ses, tam o noktadan itibaren devam eder.","words":[{"s":0,"e":882},{"s":940,"e":1312},{"s":1382,"e":2067},{"s":2148,"e":2426},{"s":2496,"e":3123},{"s":3204,"e":3750},{"s":3808,"e":4737},{"s":5132,"e":5364},{"s":5468,"e":5851},{"s":5909,"e":6281},{"s":6327,"e":6490},{"s":6571,"e":6873},{"s":6931,"e":7558},{"s":8022,"e":8510},{"s":8615,"e":8986},{"s":9056,"e":9636},{"s":9706,"e":10344},{"s":10681,"e":11250},{"s":11308,"e":11773},{"s":12074,"e":12365},{"s":12423,"e":12980},{"s":13085,"e":13572},{"s":13619,"e":13781},{"s":13863,"e":14153},{"s":14339,"e":14385},{"s":14850,"e":15314},{"s":15372,"e":16080},{"s":16614,"e":17032},{"s":17102,"e":17392},{"s":17473,"e":18019},{"s":18089,"e":18576},{"s":19308,"e":19679},{"s":19784,"e":20260},{"s":20318,"e":20550},{"s":20608,"e":20864},{"s":20910,"e":21223},{"s":21270,"e":21688},{"s":21734,"e":21862},{"s":21932,"e":22419},{"s":22489,"e":23162},{"s":23244,"e":23627},{"s":23708,"e":24219},{"s":24323,"e":24486},{"s":24567,"e":24881},{"s":25612,"e":26076},{"s":26134,"e":26355},{"s":26436,"e":26750},{"s":26808,"e":27458},{"s":27528,"e":27980},{"s":28085,"e":28967},{"s":29223,"e":29432},{"s":29513,"e":29734},{"s":29838,"e":30639},{"s":30697,"e":30987},{"s":31057,"e":31243},{"s":31324,"e":31928},{"s":31986,"e":33391},{"s":33472,"e":34146},{"s":34773,"e":35040},{"s":35121,"e":35655},{"s":35701,"e":36410},{"s":37141,"e":37965},{"s":38221,"e":38488},{"s":38592,"e":38650},{"s":38720,"e":39277},{"s":39359,"e":40078},{"s":40160,"e":40636},{"s":40717,"e":41518}]}